cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
title: "Oligo MW & Concentration Calculator"
abstract: >-
  A free tool for oligonucleotide molecular weight, extinction coefficient
  (epsilon-260), concentration and dilution, nearest-neighbour melting
  temperature with per-residue coverage reporting, and ESI mass spec (exact
  mass, elemental formula, m/z ladder). Supports DNA/RNA/hybrid strands,
  modified bases, phosphorothioate and mixed backbones, 5' and 3' end groups,
  2'-sugar modifications, user-defined custom monomers and conjugates, and
  duplexes (siRNA/ASO).
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Chen
    given-names: "Yu-Sheng"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1713-4190"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-06-25"
